WEBVTT

01:36.520 --> 01:39.890
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.080 --> 01:42.039
[Episode 16]

02:00.820 --> 02:01.820
Want a haircut?

02:02.820 --> 02:03.740
Taking a look.

02:06.170 --> 02:07.370
At what?

02:09.979 --> 02:10.720
Nothing.

02:13.470 --> 02:13.870
Uncle!

02:13.890 --> 02:14.390
Uncle!

02:15.640 --> 02:17.020
I found him!

02:17.060 --> 02:18.980
He's in that barbershop we just passed.

02:20.050 --> 02:20.840
What's he wearing?

02:20.860 --> 02:21.850
What does he look like?

02:22.470 --> 02:23.590
I didn't really notice

02:23.590 --> 02:25.300
what he's wearing.

02:25.320 --> 02:26.560
He's big and burly,

02:26.579 --> 02:27.970
and wearing a silver earring.

02:29.220 --> 02:30.920
Okay. Go home.

02:31.200 --> 02:32.160
Wait, you're going alone?

02:32.200 --> 02:32.870
Go home.

03:08.820 --> 03:10.250
Was it you who led the attack on Xie Wanghe,

03:10.310 --> 03:12.560
that student from No. 7 High School?

03:15.510 --> 03:16.930
Yes. What about it?

03:18.110 --> 03:19.630
Why did you guys beat him up?

03:19.880 --> 03:21.050
I didn't like the look of him.

03:21.600 --> 03:22.510
What's the problem?

03:25.160 --> 03:27.320
That was a bit brutal, no?

03:29.980 --> 03:31.150
Let me.

03:35.630 --> 03:36.270
Who are you?

03:37.570 --> 03:39.190
Me? My surname is Xie too.

03:39.970 --> 03:40.990
What's your name?

03:41.470 --> 03:42.740
My surname is Tong.

03:43.110 --> 03:44.520
Go ask around sometime.

03:45.060 --> 03:47.440
Everyone in this neighborhood knows me.

03:50.790 --> 03:52.530
Tong as in "child"?

03:52.829 --> 03:53.600
That's right.

03:53.829 --> 03:54.829
One name

03:54.850 --> 03:56.160
and one name only.

03:56.180 --> 03:57.590
Tong San of Flower Street.

04:07.070 --> 04:07.730
Come on!

04:17.070 --> 04:18.510
You and your dad are still not talking?

04:18.880 --> 04:20.380
What's the big grudge between you two?

04:20.510 --> 04:21.470
You talk too much.

04:26.470 --> 04:27.390
This has expired.

04:32.270 --> 04:34.470
Why are you still eating it? Are you stupid?

04:34.470 --> 04:35.270
It won't kill me.

04:35.270 --> 04:36.070
I'm starving.

04:37.430 --> 04:37.830
Here.

04:38.430 --> 04:39.310
Have this too.

04:40.510 --> 04:41.830
Go home after you finish.

04:49.830 --> 04:50.670
I'll take my time then.

04:53.420 --> 04:54.909
Causing trouble for me again!

04:55.010 --> 04:55.950
Causing trouble for me again!

04:55.990 --> 04:56.920
What are you doing, dad?

04:58.420 --> 04:59.110
What are you...

04:59.110 --> 04:59.820
I'll knock some sense into you!

04:59.870 --> 05:01.270
Why are you beating me?

05:01.290 --> 05:02.820
You're causing trouble again!

05:02.850 --> 05:04.690
Going around causing trouble!

05:04.710 --> 05:06.340
Every single day!

05:06.860 --> 05:07.950
This is what you get

05:08.270 --> 05:09.210
for causing trouble!

05:09.630 --> 05:10.620
Come here now!

05:10.990 --> 05:11.730
Come here!

05:12.020 --> 05:12.930
Come out!

05:15.570 --> 05:15.990
What are you doing?

05:16.020 --> 05:16.670
On your knees!

05:17.350 --> 05:18.150
Kneel properly.

05:18.630 --> 05:19.290
Kneel!

05:19.630 --> 05:20.280
Kneel properly!

05:20.130 --> 05:22.380
[Billiards]

05:26.040 --> 05:26.810
Mr. Xie,

05:27.580 --> 05:28.690
I'm sorry.

05:29.120 --> 05:31.270
I didn't do a good job disciplining this brat.

05:32.080 --> 05:33.140
My wife passed away early.

05:33.270 --> 05:34.350
I've been too busy earning a living.

05:34.350 --> 05:35.510
I didn't have time.

05:36.220 --> 05:37.720
How is your son now?

05:39.630 --> 05:41.030
His ribs are injured.

05:41.340 --> 05:43.870
And his left arm has a fracture.

05:46.880 --> 05:48.740
Well done, you.

05:50.420 --> 05:51.640
How much are the medical expenses?

05:51.909 --> 05:52.830
Just give me the bill,

05:52.830 --> 05:54.150
and I'll transfer the money to you right away.

05:56.270 --> 05:57.680
Money is not the issue.

05:59.020 --> 05:59.980
He needs to apologize.

06:02.570 --> 06:03.960
You heard that?

06:04.030 --> 06:05.350
I did. I did, Dad.

06:05.350 --> 06:06.220
I did.

06:24.060 --> 06:25.060
Have some soup.

06:25.570 --> 06:27.610
My mom made pork trotter soup.

06:27.620 --> 06:29.240
She added eucommia and goji berries.

06:29.270 --> 06:29.960
Great for strengthening bones.

06:31.080 --> 06:32.080
Is it any good?

06:33.600 --> 06:34.730
Try it out.

06:39.050 --> 06:39.810
Not bad.

06:42.400 --> 06:43.080
Let me.

06:43.120 --> 06:43.630
It's okay,

06:43.670 --> 06:44.340
-I'll help myself.
-Let me.

06:44.380 --> 06:45.170
I'll help myself.

06:47.720 --> 06:49.140
Don't stand on ceremony.

06:49.520 --> 06:50.890
You got beaten up because of me.

06:51.090 --> 06:51.670
Now you're injured,

06:51.700 --> 06:53.120
I must look after you.

06:55.830 --> 06:56.310
How is it?

06:57.520 --> 06:58.190
A bit higher.

07:02.750 --> 07:03.310
Fenghua,

07:04.540 --> 07:06.270
are you actually happy that I got beaten up?

07:07.820 --> 07:09.930
Or why else would you be smiling?

07:10.190 --> 07:11.800
If you want to laugh, just laugh out loud.

07:15.910 --> 07:17.550
Yes, I am happy.

07:17.570 --> 07:19.420
I'm gloating, okay?

07:19.630 --> 07:20.990
That's what you get for your loose tongue.

07:21.560 --> 07:22.130
Serves you right!

07:23.620 --> 07:24.730
Aren't you the same?

07:24.760 --> 07:26.120
Mine is self-defense.

07:27.190 --> 07:28.950
You're the one who starts it every time.

07:29.790 --> 07:30.690
Fine.

07:30.830 --> 07:32.110
I won't start anything from now on.

07:32.140 --> 07:33.670
I'll avoid you when I see you.

07:33.700 --> 07:35.000
And you'll stop telling me about your troubles.

07:35.020 --> 07:35.730
Fine, fine.

07:35.770 --> 07:36.750
Fine, fine.

07:36.909 --> 07:38.230
Blabbering non-stop.

07:38.230 --> 07:39.750
Even injuries can't shut you up.

07:40.020 --> 07:41.420
Can't you be a little gentler?

07:41.430 --> 07:42.300
Seriously, you...

07:43.630 --> 07:44.360
Siyi.

07:45.450 --> 07:47.250
Want some soup? Pork trotter soup.

07:47.290 --> 07:48.370
I'm okay.

07:48.750 --> 07:49.590
Are you alright?

07:49.630 --> 07:50.630
My grandma said you were injured.

07:50.750 --> 07:51.230
I'm fine.

07:51.230 --> 07:51.909
He's fine.

07:52.120 --> 07:53.830
It's only terminal cancer. He won't die.

07:53.990 --> 07:55.690
Shut up, will you?

07:56.150 --> 07:57.909
If I die someday, it'll be because of your curse.

07:58.230 --> 07:58.830
Honestly.

08:00.630 --> 08:02.630
Why don't you ever learn?

08:02.910 --> 08:04.190
Can't you say something auspicious?

08:04.230 --> 08:04.830
You...

08:05.340 --> 08:05.820
You...

08:06.160 --> 08:07.520
You've gotten quite bold, haven't you?

08:07.540 --> 08:08.300
-Let go!
-Let go!

08:08.350 --> 08:08.910
You do it first.

08:08.910 --> 08:09.350
You first.

08:09.630 --> 08:10.260
Three.

08:10.620 --> 08:11.030
Two.

08:16.030 --> 08:17.470
It's very good. Have some.

08:17.750 --> 08:19.700
You have some more. It's good for you.

08:20.030 --> 08:21.160
Well, I'll...

08:22.030 --> 08:22.750
Hang with us for a while?

08:23.210 --> 08:23.900
It's okay.

08:24.070 --> 08:25.440
I've got homework to do.

08:25.550 --> 08:26.130
Take care.

08:27.270 --> 08:27.910
Siyi.

08:29.480 --> 08:30.060
Good night.

08:31.220 --> 08:31.960
Good night.

08:43.909 --> 08:44.470
Siyi.

08:49.010 --> 08:50.770
It's just a bone fracture.

08:50.810 --> 08:51.950
Don't worry.

08:54.060 --> 08:55.320
Take good care of him.

08:55.340 --> 08:56.190
Let me know if anything.

08:57.560 --> 08:59.160
How about you take over tomorrow?

09:03.840 --> 09:04.470
No.

09:05.680 --> 09:07.940
I'm clumsy and not patient enough.

09:08.040 --> 09:09.510
You're much better at this.

09:10.580 --> 09:11.520
Keep it up.

10:37.940 --> 10:38.500
Hurry up.

10:39.650 --> 10:40.580
On it.

10:40.610 --> 10:41.400
What do you mean "on it"?

10:42.390 --> 10:43.310
Hurry up!

10:45.160 --> 10:46.270
Hurry!

10:46.600 --> 10:47.430
Listen.

10:48.350 --> 10:49.920
Apologize properly when you go in there.

10:50.160 --> 10:51.910
You'll look after him for the rest
of his life if it's serious.

10:52.130 --> 10:53.310
You little brat.

10:53.340 --> 10:54.660
Always up to no good.

10:54.680 --> 10:55.870
Causing trouble for me all the time!

10:55.950 --> 10:56.850
Alright.

10:57.310 --> 10:58.230
Stop shouting.

10:58.250 --> 10:58.910
We're here.

11:06.780 --> 11:07.490
Wanghe,

11:08.070 --> 11:08.810
you have a visitor.

11:28.120 --> 11:28.670
What's going on?

11:28.720 --> 11:29.770
What's with all this racket?

11:29.800 --> 11:30.820
No idea.

11:32.070 --> 11:33.680
You know him, right?

11:40.390 --> 11:41.500
I'm sorry, Xie.

11:42.070 --> 11:42.890
I did wrong.

11:44.550 --> 11:45.830
You beat him up like that,

11:45.860 --> 11:47.270
and you think a simple "sorry" will do?

11:47.300 --> 11:48.390
I won't beat him again.

11:49.330 --> 11:50.880
If I break your bones,

11:50.920 --> 11:52.930
and casually say "sorry" to you,

11:52.960 --> 11:53.960
will you let me off?

11:56.470 --> 11:58.580
This is a society governed by law.

11:58.870 --> 12:00.770
You've beaten Wanghe to this state.

12:00.790 --> 12:02.760
If we don't accept mediation,

12:03.230 --> 12:04.860
you'll end up in jail, you know that?

12:05.270 --> 12:06.370
Did you hear that?

12:06.400 --> 12:07.540
I did.

12:08.200 --> 12:10.670
From now on, when I see Xie,

12:11.090 --> 12:12.350
I'll keep out of his way.

12:12.380 --> 12:12.890
Get lost!

12:18.430 --> 12:19.560
I'm really sorry about this.

12:22.960 --> 12:23.880
What's your problem?

12:23.910 --> 12:24.790
Seriously.

12:24.830 --> 12:25.590
Mr. Xie,

12:25.950 --> 12:26.830
I'm really sorry.

12:26.920 --> 12:28.910
If you need anything else later,
just let me know.

12:29.100 --> 12:30.840
This kid came to apologize.

12:35.540 --> 12:36.230
Maotian.

12:37.170 --> 12:38.220
It's been a while.

12:38.470 --> 12:38.910
I'm sorry.

12:38.950 --> 12:39.950
My son...

12:40.330 --> 12:41.510
Well, if you'll excuse me.

12:41.550 --> 12:42.070
Okay.

12:45.210 --> 12:46.100
Alright, we're done.

12:46.190 --> 12:46.830
All settled.

12:47.660 --> 12:48.670
You can go back now.

12:49.190 --> 12:49.810
Uncle Xie.

12:51.780 --> 12:52.290
Get lost.

12:55.110 --> 12:55.510
Bye, Auntie.

12:55.550 --> 12:56.070
Bye, Uncle.

12:56.080 --> 12:56.910
What are you having?

12:56.940 --> 12:57.950
Home-style tofu.

12:58.060 --> 12:58.670
Tofu.

12:58.670 --> 12:59.590
You had dinner yet?

12:59.740 --> 13:00.700
I've got bread.

13:02.680 --> 13:03.590
Fenghua.

13:04.090 --> 13:05.990
Make sure he takes his meds.

13:06.700 --> 13:07.550
They're paying

13:07.570 --> 13:08.570
all the medical bills.

13:09.650 --> 13:10.510
And that guy,

13:10.510 --> 13:11.950
Hai,

13:11.950 --> 13:13.150
is now in custody.

13:13.890 --> 13:15.820
Let's consider this as settled now.

13:16.310 --> 13:17.700
If we don't accept mediation,

13:17.810 --> 13:19.190
they will have to pay even more.

13:19.470 --> 13:21.430
Otherwise we'll send that guy straight to jail.

13:21.740 --> 13:22.800
That would create a feud.

13:23.110 --> 13:23.710
Not ideal.

13:25.280 --> 13:26.600
You're very generous indeed.

13:26.830 --> 13:27.970
If this happened to me,

13:28.230 --> 13:29.380
my mom would try to kill them.

13:30.590 --> 13:33.540
We used to run ships on the same canal.

13:33.580 --> 13:34.570
There's no need to make things so tense.

13:40.350 --> 13:42.030
Oh, Wanghe,

13:43.080 --> 13:45.250
don't let your mom know about this.

13:45.670 --> 13:46.720
Just tell her

13:46.990 --> 13:49.140
you got injured playing basketball.

13:49.870 --> 13:51.320
I was thinking the same thing.

13:54.580 --> 13:55.260
Why?

13:56.230 --> 13:57.530
Your mom would try to kill them.

13:57.710 --> 13:58.700
So would my mom.

14:00.790 --> 14:01.950
As if things aren't bad enough already.

14:02.670 --> 14:03.410
Give me the meds.

14:05.350 --> 14:05.910
Go home.

14:06.820 --> 14:07.470
Wait.

14:08.150 --> 14:09.730
Can you manage on your own?

14:09.830 --> 14:10.780
I'll be fine.

14:12.240 --> 14:13.810
Remember to take your meds.

14:14.050 --> 14:15.370
Almost forgot my bowl.

14:18.900 --> 14:20.160
Uncle, I'm off!

14:32.750 --> 14:33.300
Dad.

14:34.000 --> 14:35.620
Who is this Xie guy?

14:36.020 --> 14:37.450
Why are you so afraid of him?

14:38.770 --> 14:39.550
It's not fear.

14:40.070 --> 14:40.750
It's respect.

14:41.590 --> 14:42.350
Why?

14:46.800 --> 14:49.120
When we were young and making a living on ships,

14:49.470 --> 14:50.430
the upstream guys

14:50.450 --> 14:51.450
ganged up on us.

14:53.320 --> 14:55.270
Boss Xie decided it was too much

14:55.310 --> 14:57.500
and risked his life to seek justice for us.

14:57.880 --> 14:59.680
He had three ribs broken.

15:07.890 --> 15:08.920
I owe him.

15:09.640 --> 15:11.040
Many people on Flower Street

15:11.580 --> 15:12.580
owe him.

15:38.820 --> 15:41.250
The once much revered "Water Dragon King"

15:41.670 --> 15:42.870
is now

15:42.910 --> 15:45.030
like a piece of driftwood fallen from a ship.

15:45.590 --> 15:47.940
Drifting aimlessly all day long,

15:48.340 --> 15:50.870
without any direction for the journey.

15:52.030 --> 15:52.740
My dad

15:53.550 --> 15:54.430
is dejected.

15:55.200 --> 15:57.630
My mom is sticking it out alone for the family.

15:58.250 --> 15:59.500
I wonder

16:00.220 --> 16:01.370
when this state of life

16:01.750 --> 16:03.390
is going to end for us.

16:30.910 --> 16:32.670
Seven seven zero nine five.

16:32.720 --> 16:33.610
This is the one.

16:37.350 --> 16:38.030
Who are you

16:38.030 --> 16:38.910
to get in the truck?

16:39.060 --> 16:40.140
Chen has a fever.

16:40.160 --> 16:41.240
I'm his buddy.

16:41.270 --> 16:41.910
I'm covering

16:41.910 --> 16:42.510
for him.

16:42.740 --> 16:44.620
Why didn't he tell me about this?

16:45.020 --> 16:46.610
You're Liang Haihong, right?

16:46.710 --> 16:47.360
Yes.

16:47.920 --> 16:49.040
Then there's no mistake.

16:51.120 --> 16:52.200
So whose job

16:52.220 --> 16:53.510
will this be?

16:53.630 --> 16:54.390
It's mine.

16:54.560 --> 16:55.240
Let's go.

16:55.600 --> 16:56.620
You have the licenses with you?

16:56.740 --> 16:57.580
Yes.

17:19.109 --> 17:19.640
That's him!

17:19.670 --> 17:20.480
What's the big occasion...

17:20.540 --> 17:21.150
Xie Tiancheng!

17:21.270 --> 17:22.339
Xie Tiancheng!

17:23.390 --> 17:24.260
Xie Tiancheng!

17:25.690 --> 17:26.599
Mr. Xie.

17:26.630 --> 17:27.630
Our savior!

17:27.960 --> 17:29.790
It was my mother-in-law who
jumped into the canal yesterday.

17:30.040 --> 17:31.230
Our kid was misbehaving

17:31.310 --> 17:32.430
and had a little argument with her.

17:32.430 --> 17:34.070
We never thought she would take it so hard

17:34.150 --> 17:35.110
and jump into the canal.

17:35.110 --> 17:35.630
It was nothing.

17:35.630 --> 17:37.030
If it weren't for you,

17:37.030 --> 17:38.670
our family would have been ruined.

17:38.750 --> 17:39.190
We're indebted.

17:39.230 --> 17:39.950
Please, please, don't.

17:40.020 --> 17:40.630
We're indebted to you.

17:40.630 --> 17:41.910
Please get up.

17:42.020 --> 17:43.510
I was just passing by and lent a hand.

17:43.510 --> 17:44.470
It's nothing, really.

17:44.630 --> 17:45.270
Sir.

17:55.420 --> 17:59.460
[To Xie Tiancheng, for his bravery to risk his life to save others]

19:05.710 --> 19:06.830
What are you doing?

19:08.770 --> 19:09.760
What are you trying to do?

19:13.130 --> 19:14.470
Come on.

19:15.370 --> 19:16.820
It's not like you're still a virgin.

19:17.410 --> 19:18.610
We're always out driving around.

19:18.630 --> 19:19.360
I mean...

19:19.420 --> 19:20.690
I wanted something exciting for us.

19:25.510 --> 19:26.260
Get out.

19:27.670 --> 19:28.600
I said get out.

19:28.810 --> 19:30.940
You hear me? I'm asking you to get out!

19:31.660 --> 19:32.930
Don't be unreasonable!

19:34.650 --> 19:36.040
Don't you know

19:36.080 --> 19:37.730
how old you are?

19:37.760 --> 19:38.960
Stop being so pretentious!

19:39.070 --> 19:40.190
Don't you dare!

19:40.430 --> 19:41.070
Don't I dare?

19:41.150 --> 19:41.590
What are you doing?

19:41.640 --> 19:42.830
I'm going to have my way with you today!

19:42.960 --> 19:43.620
Who do you think I am?

19:43.640 --> 19:44.760
What are you trying to do?

19:44.840 --> 19:45.910
I'm so going to have my way with you today!

19:45.950 --> 19:47.060
You wish!

19:47.090 --> 19:47.940
How dare you!

19:50.190 --> 19:52.060
Who do you think I am?

19:53.790 --> 19:55.340
I'll let you have your way.

19:59.700 --> 20:01.580
Get out, now.

20:03.000 --> 20:04.010
Get out.

20:11.090 --> 20:12.130
Open the door!

20:12.210 --> 20:13.050
Open the door!

20:13.740 --> 20:14.820
You're crazy!

20:14.850 --> 20:16.650
How are you going to get to Changsha
by yourself?

20:17.890 --> 20:19.510
Open the door. Come on, open it!

20:20.120 --> 20:20.840
Open the door!

20:25.170 --> 20:25.670
You...

20:26.030 --> 20:27.430
Stop!

20:27.990 --> 20:29.040
Stop now!

20:29.450 --> 20:30.500
Stop!

20:30.800 --> 20:31.850
Stop!

20:34.640 --> 20:35.700
Stop!

21:33.510 --> 21:37.680
[To Xie Tiancheng, for his bravery to risk his life to save others]

21:38.010 --> 21:38.630
Hey, son.

21:38.750 --> 21:39.750
Come out and take a look.

21:39.780 --> 21:40.770
Is it beautiful?

21:42.540 --> 21:44.170
Beautiful. Very beautiful.

21:48.370 --> 21:49.210
Honestly,

21:49.740 --> 21:51.130
can you be any more insincere?

22:15.160 --> 22:16.050
You're back.

22:16.380 --> 22:17.750
You're back. Let me.

22:17.790 --> 22:19.300
Mom. You're back.

22:22.050 --> 22:23.140
What happened to your arm?

22:23.240 --> 22:23.670
I'm fine.

22:23.720 --> 22:24.390
How did it happen?

22:24.400 --> 22:25.430
I fell while playing basketball.

22:25.620 --> 22:26.390
Right, Dad?

22:27.410 --> 22:27.990
I'm fine.

22:28.020 --> 22:28.860
I'll go back to my homework.

22:28.960 --> 22:29.900
You're not a kid anymore.

22:29.930 --> 22:30.790
I'm fine, really.

22:31.460 --> 22:32.230
Listen,

22:32.230 --> 22:33.350
it takes a lot of time to recover
from a fracture.

22:33.370 --> 22:34.270
Don't mess...

22:34.880 --> 22:35.580
I know.

22:37.040 --> 22:37.550
Alright.

22:37.560 --> 22:38.560
Come on.

22:41.690 --> 22:44.420
[To Xie Tiancheng, for his bravery to risk his life to save others]

22:51.050 --> 22:51.600
Well...

22:51.630 --> 22:52.470
You went into the canal to save someone again?

22:52.710 --> 22:55.320
I just happened to be there

22:55.350 --> 22:57.990
and lent a hand.

23:13.880 --> 23:15.740
Come have a drink with me.

23:15.850 --> 23:17.200
It'll help get you refreshed.

23:21.780 --> 23:22.410
Here.

23:29.270 --> 23:30.790
You promised me before, didn't you?

23:31.460 --> 23:32.640
Do you remember?

23:32.790 --> 23:34.430
Do you remember what you promised me?

23:34.510 --> 23:36.630
It's not winter now, right?

23:36.670 --> 23:37.350
And it was by the canal.

23:37.440 --> 23:38.630
There were lots of people around.

23:38.760 --> 23:39.070
Lots of people?

23:39.070 --> 23:39.510
There was no danger.

23:39.510 --> 23:41.270
Why didn't anyone else get in there?

23:41.310 --> 23:42.180
Only you could do that?

23:42.350 --> 23:44.160
"Those who can swim drown, and those
who're stubborn get beaten to death."

23:44.190 --> 23:45.350
Who is that saying meant for?

23:45.350 --> 23:46.280
It's exactly meant for people like you.

23:46.310 --> 23:46.670
Okay, okay, okay.

23:46.670 --> 23:47.150
You know that?

23:47.150 --> 23:48.540
From now on, when I see

23:48.630 --> 23:50.150
someone fall into the water, I won't save them.

23:50.150 --> 23:51.950
I'll just let them drown. Okay now?

23:56.990 --> 23:57.780
Okay.

23:59.680 --> 24:00.830
Do whatever you want from now on.

24:00.830 --> 24:01.830
I won't nag you again.

24:03.320 --> 24:03.870
I mean...

24:03.870 --> 24:04.590
This makes no sense.

24:04.630 --> 24:06.030
It was wrong of me to save someone's life.

24:06.070 --> 24:06.870
It wasn't wrong.

24:06.910 --> 24:08.150
You're a great hero.

24:08.270 --> 24:09.900
I'm the one who's wrong.

24:12.620 --> 24:14.030
If you have time to save other people,

24:14.030 --> 24:16.190
have you ever thought about saving me?

24:18.350 --> 24:19.110
Saving you?

24:19.790 --> 24:20.890
From what?

24:20.920 --> 24:22.100
You think I'm doing fine, don't you?

24:22.150 --> 24:22.950
Are you not?

24:24.930 --> 24:26.870
Every time I come back from a trip, I tell you

24:26.870 --> 24:28.590
how much money I've made.

24:28.620 --> 24:31.420
In your eyes, apart from being a bit tired,

24:31.750 --> 24:33.910
I don't have any other problems, right?

24:38.990 --> 24:39.720
Xie Tiancheng,

24:39.750 --> 24:40.500
come on,

24:40.500 --> 24:41.270
look at me.

24:41.400 --> 24:43.490
Do I even look like a woman now?

24:43.630 --> 24:44.910
Look!

24:45.200 --> 24:46.850
I'm practically a man now!

24:46.880 --> 24:47.910
Why am I

24:47.910 --> 24:49.350
making myself look like this?

24:49.380 --> 24:51.140
This is the only way for me

24:51.170 --> 24:52.490
to be a bit safer out there.

24:52.520 --> 24:53.860
Do you know that?

24:55.100 --> 24:57.860
But I'm still a woman after all!

24:57.910 --> 24:59.230
Now I'm out all day

24:59.230 --> 25:00.390
on the highway from dawn to dusk.

25:00.420 --> 25:02.020
Have you ever worried about me at all?

25:03.520 --> 25:05.600
Have you worried at all?

25:07.750 --> 25:09.470
During the day, when I'm out driving,

25:09.490 --> 25:09.910
I...

25:09.910 --> 25:11.630
I have to keep my eyes wide open like a cow,

25:11.630 --> 25:12.710
not daring to be distracted for a moment.

25:12.750 --> 25:13.670
But at night,

25:13.670 --> 25:14.670
I'm torn between sleeping

25:14.670 --> 25:15.830
and staying awake.

25:15.850 --> 25:17.870
If I'm deep in sleep, someone might steal
my gas in the middle of the night.

25:17.870 --> 25:19.670
If I sleep lightly, I might be
too tired the next day

25:19.690 --> 25:20.480
to drive safely.

25:20.510 --> 25:21.560
But even so,

25:21.590 --> 25:22.200
when I'm half asleep,

25:22.270 --> 25:23.270
there are still people who can

25:23.310 --> 25:24.670
take advantage of me.

25:24.670 --> 25:25.310
So tell me...

25:25.350 --> 25:26.510
Hold on.

25:26.510 --> 25:27.390
What did you just say?

25:27.430 --> 25:28.430
Someone took advantage of you?

25:28.430 --> 25:29.270
Who was it?

25:29.290 --> 25:30.050
Tell me now.

25:30.070 --> 25:30.590
Who?

25:30.750 --> 25:31.640
Mom.

25:31.970 --> 25:33.210
Mom, are you okay?

25:33.230 --> 25:33.950
You.

25:33.950 --> 25:34.960
Get away.

25:34.960 --> 25:35.930
You get away!

25:39.060 --> 25:40.820
Go on!

25:40.840 --> 25:41.720
What are you doing?

25:41.750 --> 25:42.310
Go on!

25:42.310 --> 25:43.510
Xie Tiancheng, that's enough!

25:43.550 --> 25:44.790
If you're mad, hit me!

25:44.820 --> 25:45.760
Hit me!

25:45.920 --> 25:47.200
Don't hurt my son!

25:47.220 --> 25:48.650
Hit me instead!

25:49.900 --> 25:51.380
Are you even a man anymore?

25:52.030 --> 25:53.750
Do you know how dangerous it is for a woman

25:53.750 --> 25:54.730
to do long-distance truck runs?

25:54.750 --> 25:56.530
Do you know how hard it is?

25:57.630 --> 25:59.360
If you were serious with the supermarket,

25:59.390 --> 26:00.600
I wouldn't say anything.

26:00.940 --> 26:01.810
But look at you.

26:02.340 --> 26:03.070
Occupied with eating,

26:03.110 --> 26:03.830
drinking,

26:03.910 --> 26:04.870
and playing!

26:04.900 --> 26:07.100
One month into running the supermarket
and you're losing money every day!

26:07.660 --> 26:09.770
I printed out reference materials
on the retail industry for you.

26:09.800 --> 26:10.760
Did you ever read them?

26:11.190 --> 26:12.840
You come home and drink

26:12.860 --> 26:14.480
until well past midnight every day.

26:14.510 --> 26:15.720
You think you're the only one who's suffering?

26:15.940 --> 26:17.890
You're the only one in the world
who's suffering?

26:20.480 --> 26:21.830
Mom is out there on the road,

26:22.820 --> 26:24.340
enduring it all alone for this family.

26:25.420 --> 26:26.650
If you can't take care of her,

26:26.690 --> 26:27.680
I will!

26:29.460 --> 26:31.600
I can give up the college entrance exam!

26:32.180 --> 26:33.500
I'll accompany Mom on her truck runs.

26:33.530 --> 26:35.320
I'll protect my mom!

26:38.320 --> 26:39.330
Son...

27:39.870 --> 27:40.550
Haihong.

27:41.000 --> 27:41.480
Breakfast is ready.

27:43.740 --> 27:44.420
Haihong.

28:20.060 --> 28:20.830
Haihong.

28:23.980 --> 28:24.960
It's me!

28:24.980 --> 28:26.780
It's me!

28:33.730 --> 28:35.350
A nightmare, isn't it?

28:42.270 --> 28:43.260
I've decided.

28:45.740 --> 28:46.910
Starting tomorrow,

28:46.980 --> 28:48.180
I'll accompany you on your truck runs.

28:54.190 --> 28:55.440
For a woman,

28:56.880 --> 28:58.270
this work is too hard.

29:04.240 --> 29:05.890
I'm losing money

29:05.920 --> 29:08.560
running that floating supermarket anyway.

29:09.430 --> 29:10.990
And Maotian and his wife

29:11.020 --> 29:12.610
are arguing about this all the time.

29:13.090 --> 29:14.750
It'd be best if I

29:15.410 --> 29:16.210
got out of this.

29:20.310 --> 29:21.550
I've thought it all through.

29:23.530 --> 29:24.490
At my age,

29:25.050 --> 29:26.230
I can't really

29:27.720 --> 29:29.220
accomplish much anymore.

29:38.660 --> 29:39.680
Why are you crying?

29:39.760 --> 29:40.810
What's wrong?

29:43.960 --> 29:46.120
I don't want you to suffer.

29:46.940 --> 29:48.630
How would I be suffering?

29:52.380 --> 29:54.150
You're the one who's been suffering.

29:58.800 --> 30:00.700
I'll try to get a driver's license too

30:01.590 --> 30:02.910
sometime soon.

30:03.920 --> 30:05.530
We'll bite the bullet for two more years.

30:06.360 --> 30:08.510
We need to earn enough

30:08.750 --> 30:09.870
for our son's tuition, right?

30:11.340 --> 30:12.030
Right.

30:15.320 --> 30:16.180
Let's eat.

30:16.820 --> 30:19.080
I've made breakfast.

30:22.480 --> 30:24.970
I'll go get the rice.

30:49.060 --> 30:50.020
Wait for your mom.

32:05.110 --> 32:06.800
From now on,

32:07.710 --> 32:09.440
take good care of yourself.

32:09.520 --> 32:11.320
Don't make us worry about you.

32:11.350 --> 32:12.840
That would be a great help to us.

32:12.860 --> 32:13.800
Understood?

32:14.320 --> 32:15.290
Understood.

32:15.510 --> 32:17.310
I promise not to upset the teachers.

32:20.270 --> 32:23.040
Stay out of trouble and don't
go to internet cafes too often.

32:23.950 --> 32:25.050
For meals,

32:25.540 --> 32:26.740
go eat at Fenghua's place.

32:26.840 --> 32:27.890
Don't upset her.

32:29.100 --> 32:30.490
I'm not a three-year-old.

32:30.550 --> 32:31.590
You can rest assured.

32:32.280 --> 32:34.560
I actually wish you were three years old.

32:43.820 --> 32:44.590
Dad.

32:57.850 --> 32:58.810
What's this?

32:59.650 --> 33:00.550
If you get bored,

33:00.630 --> 33:02.030
have a listen for some amusement.

33:09.350 --> 33:09.820
Well?

33:09.820 --> 33:10.730
Are we ready?

33:11.390 --> 33:12.050
Don't rush me.

33:12.730 --> 33:13.500
We have everything now.

33:14.910 --> 33:15.730
Son...

33:17.270 --> 33:18.390
Let's go, come on.

33:18.420 --> 33:18.870
Be good.

33:18.910 --> 33:19.590
Come on, let's go.

33:19.890 --> 33:20.760
Be good!

33:22.020 --> 33:22.930
Be safe.

33:24.730 --> 33:26.750
Drive slowly in the rain. Don't rush!

33:26.830 --> 33:27.770
I know!

33:28.230 --> 33:29.330
Take care of yourself!

33:49.810 --> 33:50.470
What's wrong?

33:50.920 --> 33:51.510
Nothing.

33:51.920 --> 33:52.980
All good.

33:53.130 --> 33:54.010
Just keep driving.

34:05.630 --> 34:06.540
What's that?

34:06.560 --> 34:08.130
Before we left, our son

34:08.350 --> 34:09.770
gave me this tape.

34:09.810 --> 34:11.370
He said I could listen to it on the road.

34:12.460 --> 34:13.770
Why didn't you take it out earlier?

34:13.900 --> 34:15.040
I forgot.

34:16.489 --> 34:17.590
Okay, next up,

34:17.590 --> 34:19.630
Xie Wanghe, a student from
Honghuai No. 7 High School,

34:19.630 --> 34:21.360
has dedicated a song to his father.

34:21.429 --> 34:22.750
This song is called

34:22.810 --> 34:23.929
"Love You Dad."

34:23.949 --> 34:25.600
Let's listen together.

34:34.199 --> 34:37.230
♫Dad, you've got a big belly♫

34:38.010 --> 34:40.239
♫A bad temper and no hair♫

34:40.840 --> 34:42.440
♫You do not bend easily in life♫

34:42.630 --> 34:44.310
♫You grow the hard way♫

34:43.219 --> 34:43.960
Am I bald?

34:44.719 --> 34:46.230
♫I'll be by your side♫

34:45.469 --> 34:46.389
Isn't my hair still

34:46.469 --> 34:47.070
right here?

34:46.590 --> 34:47.949
♫Even though you're getting balder every day♫

34:48.210 --> 34:50.690
♫I love you, Dad♫

34:48.620 --> 34:49.750
It's just a song.

34:50.050 --> 34:51.150
That's just one of the lines.

34:51.510 --> 34:52.429
Don't take it so seriously.

34:51.590 --> 34:54.730
♫I love you, Dad♫

35:07.490 --> 35:08.950
♫I love you, Dad♫

35:09.740 --> 35:12.190
♫Love your hair♫

35:14.750 --> 35:16.830
♫I love you, Dad♫

35:17.400 --> 35:19.870
♫Be sure to come home soon after work♫

35:23.430 --> 35:24.760
Not bad.

35:25.900 --> 35:27.240
Out of 17 calculation questions,

35:27.350 --> 35:28.900
you only got two wrong.

35:29.670 --> 35:30.470
Wanghe,

35:30.690 --> 35:31.590
if you work a little harder,

35:31.590 --> 35:33.190
you might really have a chance.

35:35.270 --> 35:36.640
Remove the "might."

35:37.310 --> 35:38.330
I definitely have a chance.

35:47.470 --> 35:48.950
Do you think Siyi

35:48.970 --> 35:50.170
is acting strange lately?

35:50.700 --> 35:51.850
Remove the "Do you think."

35:52.550 --> 35:53.940
Something's off with her.

35:53.960 --> 35:54.640
Right?

35:54.950 --> 35:57.620
Even though she's never been talkative,

35:57.660 --> 35:59.820
she used to talk back when we teased her.

36:00.070 --> 36:01.510
These past couple of days, she's been gloomy

36:01.510 --> 36:02.480
and hasn't said a word.

36:03.870 --> 36:06.440
I hope it's not because of her mom again.

36:06.830 --> 36:08.680
Should I ask Fenghua to check on her?

36:08.990 --> 36:09.860
That works.

36:10.310 --> 36:11.350
Go get her.

36:11.370 --> 36:12.090
I'll talk to her.

36:13.070 --> 36:14.190
I, I, I...

36:14.390 --> 36:15.510
Go, go, go. Hurry up.

36:21.780 --> 36:22.690
Wanghe,

36:23.140 --> 36:25.520
your math and English should be fine.

36:26.280 --> 36:28.540
But your Chinese needs some work,

36:28.980 --> 36:30.550
especially the writing part.

36:31.050 --> 36:31.880
How do I work on that?

36:34.420 --> 36:36.290
Maybe you could ask Xingchi's dad?

36:36.550 --> 36:37.290
No way.

36:38.030 --> 36:40.440
Uncle Shao can't speak without using archaisms.

36:40.510 --> 36:41.260
It gives me a headache.

36:47.990 --> 36:48.860
What?

36:49.600 --> 36:50.430
Fenghua,

36:50.830 --> 36:52.770
is something wrong with Siyi lately?

36:52.940 --> 36:54.080
What's wrong?

36:54.500 --> 36:55.550
She seems a little down.

36:56.610 --> 36:57.470
She's not talking

36:57.550 --> 36:58.500
or smiling.

36:58.830 --> 37:00.410
Isn't she always like that?

37:00.910 --> 37:01.440
Well,

37:02.410 --> 37:04.460
I feel like it's been worse
these past couple of days.

37:04.490 --> 37:06.470
Go ask her if everything's okay.

37:06.570 --> 37:09.180
If there's anything wrong,
we can work it out together.

37:09.270 --> 37:10.430
She shouldn't keep it to herself.

37:10.560 --> 37:11.080
Go now.

37:13.140 --> 37:13.710
Hurry up.

37:15.370 --> 37:16.480
Mind your tone.

37:17.910 --> 37:18.950
Go, go, go. Just go ask her.

37:19.520 --> 37:20.160
Fenghua,

37:20.190 --> 37:21.500
just go ask her.

38:00.910 --> 38:01.540
Busy?

38:08.410 --> 38:09.320
Not really.

38:11.950 --> 38:13.040
Can we talk somewhere else?

38:30.210 --> 38:30.910
Wanghe

38:30.910 --> 38:31.950
asked me to ask you

38:32.420 --> 38:34.330
if there's something going on at home.

38:35.820 --> 38:36.310
Like what?

38:40.160 --> 38:42.410
He thinks your mood has been off
these past couple of days.

38:42.760 --> 38:43.870
He's a bit worried.

38:45.150 --> 38:45.710
Oh.

38:47.020 --> 38:48.020
Just "oh"?

38:49.740 --> 38:51.330
What do you want me to say?

38:51.660 --> 38:53.270
Why don't you come up with an excuse for me?

39:02.550 --> 39:04.160
Actually, I'd like to know as well...

39:05.180 --> 39:06.380
what's on your mind.

39:11.110 --> 39:12.020
What can be on my mind?

39:13.950 --> 39:15.720
I just want to focus on the college entrance exam.

39:16.160 --> 39:17.630
Nothing else matters.

39:18.930 --> 39:20.300
What about after the exam?

39:23.100 --> 39:24.910
We can leave that for later.

39:25.990 --> 39:27.270
I don't have time to think about
anything else right now.

39:30.310 --> 39:30.880
I see.

39:44.910 --> 39:46.390
What exactly do you want to ask?

39:47.190 --> 39:47.990
Just say it.

39:55.670 --> 39:57.680
So... do you like him?

40:09.720 --> 40:11.240
The word "like"...

40:11.810 --> 40:13.290
is too much of a luxury for me.

40:18.200 --> 40:19.890
At least for now...

40:20.990 --> 40:21.840
I don't deserve it.

40:33.870 --> 40:35.070
As for you,

40:36.660 --> 40:38.440
whether you see me as a rival or not,

40:39.490 --> 40:40.490
I don't care.

40:41.590 --> 40:43.370
I've always seen you

40:43.410 --> 40:46.260
as my closest and best sister.

40:47.720 --> 40:49.520
Other than my grandma,

40:49.550 --> 40:51.230
you're the person I'm closest to.

40:54.140 --> 40:55.210
If one day

40:55.550 --> 40:56.840
we really fall out,

40:57.570 --> 40:59.630
I hope it won't be over something so trivial.

41:02.110 --> 41:03.540
What else then?

41:04.310 --> 41:06.080
You really want to fall out with me?

41:14.220 --> 41:15.010
Fenghua,

41:17.140 --> 41:19.160
I have only one piece of advice for you.

41:19.170 --> 41:21.550
Work hard, and then harder.

41:22.590 --> 41:24.030
Always look straight ahead.

41:24.740 --> 41:25.820
Don't look up to people.

41:26.940 --> 41:28.460
Being humble is a disease,

41:28.870 --> 41:29.750
a terminal one.

41:34.430 --> 41:36.060
You'll understand when you're older.

41:46.350 --> 41:48.110
Why are their lights off?

41:49.940 --> 41:51.800
Come on now. Let's figure it out tomorrow.

42:20.470 --> 42:22.470
You've been brushing your teeth there
for half an hour now.

42:22.470 --> 42:24.310
Your teeth must be smoking.

42:25.200 --> 42:25.510
Fenghua,

42:27.380 --> 42:28.960
I waited for you till midnight last night.

42:29.790 --> 42:30.730
Let me get that for you.

42:31.480 --> 42:33.250
How did your chat go?

42:35.330 --> 42:36.980
Come on, tell me what you two talked about.

42:37.000 --> 42:38.890
Don't bother me, I'm so tired.

42:38.990 --> 42:39.750
Just tell me.

42:40.880 --> 42:41.710
Fenghua.

42:43.370 --> 42:44.160
Siyi!

42:44.180 --> 42:45.100
Wait for me!

42:45.120 --> 42:45.780
Siyi.

42:49.380 --> 42:50.750
I haven't got my backpack yet.

42:52.710 --> 42:53.560
Move aside.

42:56.470 --> 42:57.060
What did you talk about?

42:57.060 --> 42:59.070
Are you not going with me?
